<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Aura - Vendez simplement. Gérez efficacement.</title>
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/logo.png" type="image/png">
  <meta name="description" content="La plateforme tout-en-un pour gérer votre activité de vente. Produits, commandes, clients - tout au même endroit.">
  
  <style>
    /* ========================================
       VARIABLES & RESET
       ======================================== */
    :root {
      --color-primary: #253337;
      --color-secondary: #5C6C73;
      --color-accent: #E0FCFC;
      --color-success: #4CAF50;
      --color-white: #FFFFFF;
      --color-text: #1a1a1a;
      --color-text-light: #666666;
      --color-border: rgba(37, 51, 55, 0.1);
      --color-surface: #F5F7F9;
      
      --gradient-primary: linear-gradient(135deg, #253337, #5C6C73);
      --gradient-accent: linear-gradient(135deg, #E0FCFC, #C2E0E3);
      
      --radius-sm: 8px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --radius-lg: 16px;
      --radius-xl: 24px;
      
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      --shadow-lg: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
      
      --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }
    
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--color-text);
      background: var(--color-white);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       HEADER / NAVIGATION
       ======================================== */
    .header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      z-index: 1000;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    
    .header.scrolled {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    
    .nav {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    
    .logo {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--gradient-primary);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    
    .nav-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       BUTTONS
       ======================================== */
    .btn {
      padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: var(--transition);
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      border: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--gradient-primary);
      color: var(--color-white);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }
    
    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }
    
    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
    }
    
    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: var(--color-primary);
      color: var(--color-white);
    }
    
    .btn-ghost {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--color-secondary);
      border: none;
    }
    
    .btn-ghost:hover {
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       HERO SECTION
       ======================================== */
    .hero {
      padding: 8rem 2rem 6rem;
      background: var(--gradient-accent);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -10%;
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 51, 55, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    
    .hero-content {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
      background: var(--color-white);
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    
    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.375rem;
      color: var(--color-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       SECTIONS
       ======================================== */
    .section {
      padding: 6rem 2rem;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }
    
    .section-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      background: var(--color-accent);
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    .section-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    .section-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       PROBLEM & SOLUTION
       ======================================== */
    .problem-solution {
      background: var(--color-surface);
    }
    
    .problem-solution-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 3rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    
    .problem-card, .solution-card {
      padding: 2rem;
      background: var(--color-white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    
    .card-icon {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .problem-card .card-icon {
      background: rgba(244, 67, 54, 0.1);
    }
    
    .solution-card .card-icon {
      background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.1);
    }
    
    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    .card-text {
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       FEATURES
       ======================================== */
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .feature-card {
      padding: 2rem;
      background: var(--color-white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    
    .feature-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-primary);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }
    
    .feature-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: var(--gradient-accent);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .feature-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    
    .feature-text {
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       PRICING
       ======================================== */
    .pricing {
      background: var(--gradient-accent);
    }
    
    .pricing-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    
    .pricing-card {
      background: var(--color-white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 2.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      transition: var(--transition);
      position: relative;
    }
    
    .pricing-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }
    
    .pricing-card.featured {
      border: 3px solid var(--color-primary);
    }
    
    .pricing-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: -12px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--color-primary);
      color: var(--color-white);
      padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    
    .pricing-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    
    .pricing-name {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .pro {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    
    .pricing-price {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    
    .pricing-period {
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    
    .pricing-features {
      list-style: none;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    
    .pricing-features li {
      padding: 0.75rem 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }
    
    .pricing-features li:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    
    .pricing-features li::before {
      content: '';
      color: var(--color-success);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       TARGET AUDIENCE
       ======================================== */
    .audience-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    
    .audience-card {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }
    
    .audience-icon {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    .audience-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    
    .audience-text {
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       CTA FINAL
       ======================================== */
    .cta-final {
      padding: 6rem 2rem;
      background: var(--gradient-primary);
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--color-white);
    }
    
    .cta-final-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .cta-final-text {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }
    
    .btn-white {
      background: var(--color-white);
      color: var(--color-primary);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      padding: 1rem 3rem;
    }
    
    .btn-white:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       FOOTER
       ======================================== */
    .footer {
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      background: var(--color-primary);
      color: var(--color-white);
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .footer-logo {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    .footer-text {
      opacity: 0.8;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
    
    /* ========================================
       RESPONSIVE
       ======================================== */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav {
        padding: 1rem;
      }
      
      .hero {
        padding: 6rem 1rem 4rem;
      }
      
      .hero-title {
        font-size: 2.25rem;
      }
      
      .hero-subtitle {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
      }
      
      .hero-actions {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      
      .section {
        padding: 4rem 1rem;
      }
      
      .section-title {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }
      
      .problem-solution-grid,
      .pricing-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      
      .cta-final-title {
        font-size: 1.875rem;
      }
      
      .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <style>.svg-icon{display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.125em;flex-shrink:0;}</style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- ========================================
       HEADER
       ======================================== -->
  <header class="header" id="header">
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="logo"> <img src="/images/logo.png" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;" width="50" height="50" alt="AURA"> Aura</div>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-ghost">Se connecter</a>
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Commencer gratuitement</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- ========================================
       HERO SECTION
       ======================================== -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-rocket" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"></path><path d="M12 15l-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"></path><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path></svg> La solution pour les vendeurs modernes</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Vendez simplement.<br>Gérez efficacement.</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Transformez votre activité de vente avec une plateforme tout-en-un. 
        Gérez vos produits, suivez vos commandes et développez votre business sans complications.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Démarrer gratuitement</a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-outline">Voir les tarifs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================
       PROBLEM & SOLUTION
       ======================================== -->
  <section class="section problem-solution">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-badge">Le constat</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Vendre sur WhatsApp, c'est compliqué</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Nous comprenons vos défis quotidiens. Voici comment Aura vous simplifie la vie.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="problem-solution-grid">
      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="card-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-sad" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="9.01" y2="9"></line><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="15.01" y2="9"></line><path d="M16 17c-.83-1.2-2.26-2-4-2s-3.17.8-4 2"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Messages perdus, commandes oubliées</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Jongler entre WhatsApp, Excel et votre mémoire ? Les erreurs s'accumulent et vous perdez du temps précieux.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="solution-card">
        <div class="card-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-check-circle" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg></div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Tout centralisé au même endroit</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Gérez vos produits, commandes et clients depuis une seule interface. Plus de stress, juste de l'efficacité.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="card-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-chart-histogram" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg></div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Aucune visibilité sur votre activité</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Impossible de savoir combien vous vendez réellement, quels sont vos meilleurs produits ou vos clients fidèles.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="solution-card">
        <div class="card-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-stats-up" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"></polyline><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"></polyline></svg></div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Statistiques claires et actionables</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Visualisez vos ventes, identifiez vos tops produits et prenez des décisions basées sur des données réelles.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================
       FEATURES
       ======================================== -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-badge">Fonctionnalités</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Tout ce dont vous avez besoin</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Une plateforme complète pour gérer votre activité de A à Z
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-box" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21 8v13H3V8"></path><path d="M1 3h22v5H1z"></path><line x1="10" y1="12" x2="14" y2="12"></line></svg></div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Gestion des produits</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">
          Créez votre catalogue en quelques clics. Ajoutez photos, descriptions, prix et stock. Partagez vos produits via des liens directs.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-shopping-cart" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"></circle><path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Suivi des commandes</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">
          Recevez, organisez et suivez toutes vos commandes. Mettez à jour les statuts en temps réel et ne perdez plus jamais une vente.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-chart-histogram" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg></div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Tableau de bord intuitif</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">
          Visualisez votre activité d'un coup d'œil : ventes du mois, produits populaires, revenus. Des insights pour grandir.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-link" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Liens de partage produits</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">
          Chaque produit a son lien unique. Partagez sur WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook. Vos clients commandent en un clic.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-users" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Base clients intégrée</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">
          Gardez trace de vos clients, leur historique d'achats et leurs préférences. Fidélisez plus facilement.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-bolt" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Simple et rapide</h3>
        <p class="feature-text">
          Pas besoin d'être un expert. Interface claire, navigation intuitive. Démarrez en moins de 5 minutes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================
       PRICING
       ======================================== -->
  <section class="section pricing" id="pricing">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-badge">Tarifs</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Des plans adaptés à votre croissance</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Commencez gratuitement, évoluez à votre rythme
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="pricing-grid">
      <% if (typeof plans !== 'undefined' && plans.length > 0) { %>
        <% 
          const fmtCurrency = (n) => (parseFloat(n)||0).toLocaleString('fr-FR') + ' FCFA';
          plans.forEach(plan => { 
            const isFeatured = plan.slug === 'pro';
        %>
          <div class="pricing-card <%= isFeatured ? 'featured' : '' %>">
            <% if (isFeatured) { %>
              <div class="pricing-badge"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg> Populaire</div>
            <% } %>
            <div class="pricing-header">
              <h3 class="pricing-name <%= plan.slug %>"><%= plan.name %></h3>
              <div class="pricing-price">
                <%= plan.price == 0 ? 'Gratuit' : fmtCurrency(plan.price) %>
              </div>
              <p class="pricing-period"><%= plan.billing_cycle === 'monthly' ? 'Par mois' : 'Par an' %></p>
            </div>
            
            <ul class="pricing-features">
              <li>
                <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <strong><%= plan.max_products === -1 || plan.max_products >= 999999 ? 'Produits illimités' : 'Jusqu\'à ' + plan.max_products + ' produits' %></strong>
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <%= plan.max_orders_per_month === -1 || plan.max_orders_per_month >= 999999 ? 'Commandes illimitées' : plan.max_orders_per_month + ' commandes / semaine' %>
              </li>
              <% if (plan.has_analytics) { %>
                <li><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>Tableau de bord & Stats</li>
              <% } %>
              <% if (plan.has_custom_branding) { %>
                <li><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>Personnalisation boutique</li>
              <% } %>
              <% if (plan.has_whatsapp_integration) { %>
                <li><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>Intégration WhatsApp Business</li>
              <% } %>
              <% if (plan.slug === 'business') { %>
                <li><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>Intégrations Social Media</li>
                <li><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>Rapports détaillés</li>
              <% } %>
              <% if (plan.trial_days > 0 && plan.price > 0) { %>
                <li style="color:var(--color-primary); font-weight:700;">
                  <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                  <%= plan.trial_days %> jours d'essai gratuit
                </li>
              <% } %>
            </ul>
            
            <a href="/register" class="btn <%= isFeatured ? 'btn-primary' : 'btn-outline' %>" style="width: 100%;">
              <%= plan.price == 0 ? 'Démarrer gratuitement' : 'Choisir ' + plan.name %>
            </a>
          </div>
        <% }); %>
      <% } else { %>
        <p style="grid-column: 1/-1; text-align: center; color: var(--color-tertiary);">Aucun plan d'abonnement disponible pour le moment.</p>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================
       TARGET AUDIENCE
       ======================================== -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-badge">Pour qui ?</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Aura est fait pour vous</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Quelle que soit votre activité, simplifiez votre gestion
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="audience-grid">
      <div class="audience-card">
        <div class="audience-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-shopping-bag" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path></svg>️</div>
        <h3 class="audience-title">Petits commerçants</h3>
        <p class="audience-text">
          Vendez vos produits localement avec une gestion professionnelle
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="audience-card">
        <div class="audience-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-briefcase" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="audience-title">Entrepreneurs</h3>
        <p class="audience-text">
          Lancez votre business avec les bons outils dès le premier jour
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="audience-card">
        <div class="audience-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-smartphone" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line></svg></div>
        <h3 class="audience-title">Vendeurs WhatsApp</h3>
        <p class="audience-text">
          Structurez vos ventes sans quitter WhatsApp
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="audience-card">
        <div class="audience-icon"><svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-camera" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="4"></circle></svg></div>
        <h3 class="audience-title">Vendeurs Instagram</h3>
        <p class="audience-text">
          Convertissez vos abonnés en clients facilement
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================
       CTA FINAL
       ======================================== -->
  <section class="cta-final">
    <h2 class="cta-final-title">Prêt à transformer votre activité ?</h2>
    <p class="cta-final-text">
      Rejoignez des centaines de vendeurs qui ont simplifié leur gestion avec Aura
    </p>
    <a href="/register" class="btn btn-white">Créer mon compte gratuitement →</a>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================
       FOOTER
       ======================================== -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-logo">Aura</div>
    <p class="footer-text">
      La plateforme tout-en-un pour gérer votre activité de vente
    </p>
    <p class="footer-text" style="margin-top: 1rem; opacity: 0.6;">
      <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-fi-rr-copyright" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M14.83 9a4 4 0 1 0 0 6"></path></svg> 2026 Aura. Tous droits réservés.
    </p>
  </footer>

  <!-- ========================================
       JAVASCRIPT
       ======================================== -->
  <script src="/js/landing.js"></script>
</body>
</html>